ometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="32" value="UC38: Revenue Pool = fulfilled-order revenue − locked Standard Cost; largest-remainder rounding; loss capped at capital (TL-12/13). UC37 opens a 7–14 day feedback window; UC39 is allowed only after the window closes with no open feedback and locks the statement (BR-30). UC43 exports the hash-chained audit log (TL-08)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="455" width="820" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>